  "functionalChecks": [
    "Course creation through the shared sticky Save bar returns to the course list.",
    "Icon catalog is initially collapsed; selecting an icon closes it and preserves the selected form value.",
    "Achievement choice populates one editor; only one award action is rendered.",
    "Registration validates the account step, preserves values on Back, and keeps optional profile fields collapsed.",
    "Community search covers the whole server query and handles no matches.",
    "Store search and availability filters combine; unavailable cards are hidden by the availability filter.",
    "Journal sticky student column leaves space for marks at 390 px; a chapter filter is available.",
    "Planner drag and drop attaches content and persists after reload.",
    "Planner mobile catalog adds material through its Add button.",
    "Planner overview places the workload chart before coverage; tabs have no vertical scrollbar.",
    "Chapter timeline supports preview and commit from keyboard, with 44 px touch height.",
    "Violet palette applied to courses, course, community and report without overflow or JavaScript errors.",
    "Course, community, store, journal and planner do not overflow at 320 px.",
    "Review header and its action menu work at 320, 390 and 1440 px after the overflow fix.",
    "Sticker preview initializes after DOM readiness without JavaScript errors."
  ],
  "tests": {
    "command": "php artisan test --compact",
    "passed": 530,
    "assertions": 4422
  },
